# Pull new mail from Fastmail's INBOX into a local maildir.
#
# Only new messages move, and only from Fastmail to here: nothing is
# sent back, and nothing is removed from the maildir. A message
# deleted or moved on Fastmail stays here.

IMAPAccount fastmail
Host imap.fastmail.com
Port 993
TLSType IMAPS
UserCmd "sed -n 1p /data/secrets/mail-creds"
PassCmd "sed -n 2p /data/secrets/mail-creds"

IMAPStore fastmail
Account fastmail

MaildirStore local
Path /data/mail/maildir/
Inbox /data/mail/maildir/INBOX

Channel lists
Far :fastmail:INBOX
Near :local:INBOX
Create Near
Sync Pull New
Expunge None
Remove None
CopyArrivalDate yes
SyncState /data/mail/mbsync/
